# Naban, Dean of Iteration's "Wizard" is a word of its text (CR 612): Artificial Evolution replacing Wizard with Elf in it
# makes it a Human Elf whose rule reads "If an Elf you control entering causes ...". Naban entering on turn 1, before the
# change, makes Aunt May trigger twice (22). After it, Llanowar Elves entering on turn 3 makes Aunt May trigger twice (24),
# and Emry, Lurker of the Loch, a Merfolk Wizard, entering on turn 5 makes it trigger once (25) - beside Emry's own "mill
# four cards", two triggers to order.
# Turn 1: the Plains pays Aunt May; Black Lotus (UUU) pays Naban and the Evolution. Turn 3: the Forest pays the Elves.
